From 79104462a01fe4491981aa3093d5e03aa8353b8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:06:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Event Timers: the folded bosses now, soon and later, each
 part on or off

Folded, the bosses stood in one list (below each other) or in two columns,
"now & soon" and later (side by side). They are now three parts, each with
its heading: up, running or in their window (now); due within 15 minutes
(soon); and the rest within the chosen time (later). Side by side that is
four columns with the events. A bar at the top of the folded view has a
button for each part (Events, Now, Soon, Later) to show or hide it, kept
with the settings (the last one shown stays), and the layout button.
Side by side an empty part keeps its column, marked "None right now", so
the columns don't jump around; below each other it leaves no gap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBQati3x8VviBbpY9juEWf
